                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "Das Lied von Eis und Feuer"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "Hikari (Astrum-Trupp)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "Hört! Ein Schatten schreitet in Glut; Sterne werden Asche.\r\nNoch glimmt die Glut; der Frostkönig trägt die Schneekrone.\r\nKein Eis schützt euch; die Kälte singt den Toten zu—\r\nAuf, Jäger! Singt mit Stahl; der Morgen wahre euren Namen."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 7,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "Pieśń lodu i ognia"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "Hikari (Oddział Astrum)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "Słuchaj! Cień kroczy w ogniu; gwiazdy gasną w popiele.\r\nŻar jeszcze żyje; król mrozu wkłada koronę ze śniegu.\r\nLód nie da osłony; chłód śpiewa pieśń poległym —\r\nPowstań, łowco! Śpiewaj stalą; niech świt pamięta twe imię."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 21,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "أغنية الجليد والنار"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "هيكاري (وحدة أستروم)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "اسمع! ظل يمشي في اللهب، والنجوم تصير رماداً.\r\nلم تبرد الجمرات؛ وملك الصقيع يلبس تاج الثلج.\r\nلا درع من جليد؛ والبرد ينشد لمن سقطوا —\r\nانهض أيها الصياد! غن بسيفك، وليحفظ الفجر اسمك."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 2,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "Le Chant de la glace et du feu"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "Hikari (Unité Astrum)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "Écoutez ! L'ombre marche en feu ; les astres sont cendres.\r\nLa braise vit encore ; le roi du givre se couronne de neige.\r\nNul rempart de glace ; le froid chante pour les morts —\r\nDebout, chasseur ! Que l'acier chante ton nom à l'aurore."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 3,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "Un canto di ghiaccio e fuoco"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "Hikari (Unità Astrum)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "Udite! Un'ombra avanza nel fuoco; le stelle sono cenere.\r\nLa brace vive; il re del gelo indossa la corona di neve.\r\nNessuno scudo di ghiaccio; il freddo canta per i caduti—\r\nSorgi, cacciatore! Canta col ferro; l'alba ricordi il tuo nome."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 5,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "Canción de hielo y fuego"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "Hikari (Unidad Astrum)"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "¡Oíd! Una sombra anda en llamas; las estrellas son ceniza.\r\nAún vive la brasa; el rey de la escarcha se corona de nieve.\r\nSin escudo de hielo, el frío canta por los caídos—\r\n¡Alzaos, cazadores! Cantad con acero; que el alba os recuerde."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 11,
            "MessageData": [
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_000",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_001",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_100",
                    "Text": "얼음과 불의 노래"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_101",
                    "Text": "별 부대　히카리"
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_102",
                    "Text": "들으라! 검은 그림자가 불길을 밟고 별은 재가 된다.\r\n불씨 식기 전에 서리 왕이 눈의 왕관을 쓴다.\r\n얼음 방패 없는 땅, 한파는 쓰러진 이를 노래한다—\r\n일어나라, 사냥꾼! 칼로 노래해 새벽에 이름을 새겨라."
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_122",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_123",
                    "Text": ""
                },
                {
                    "Name": "Mission10101_132",
                    "Text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Language": 32,
